121 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/P 63 0 R
/T (Each run uses 10,000 references over 100 page IDs. Within a seed, all three policies process the identical reference string. The same generator code runs for every pattern. The loop pattern is deterministic, so its standard deviation is zero. Seeds 1 to 5 are used throughout.)
/E (Each run uses 10,000 references over 100 page IDs. Within a seed, all three policies process the identical reference string. The same generator code runs for every pattern. The loop pattern is deterministic, so its standard deviation is zero. Seeds 1 to 5 are used throughout.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [7]
>>
