571 0 obj
<<
/Title (Before the main runs, I checked the simulator against two known examples. On the textbook string 7, 0, 1, 2, 0, 3, 0, 4, 2, 3, 0, 3, 2, 1, 2, 0, 1, 7, 0, 1 with 3 frames, the simulator gives FIFO 15 faults, LRU 12 and OPT 9. These match the standard textbook values. On Belady's string 1, 2, 3, 4, 1, 2, 5, 1, 2, 3, 4, 5, FIFO faults 9 times with 3 frames and 10 times with 4 frames, which reproduces the anomaly.)
